  - lines 162, 517, 602–603, 653–654, 666 the branch name in log/error text → `ws.label`; heads in the "moved" error (517) → `shortHead(...)`;
  - lines 177, 245 `fixBase` → `await ws.head()`; 200 `startHumanRound(opts.runDir, humanRound, ws.base, await ws.head())`; 383 and 514 `head` / `moved` → `ws.head()`;
  - lines 363–373 `buildReviewerContext({ ..., workspace: ws, ...(ws.note ? { note: ws.note } : {}) })`;
